---
title: How to Set Up Automated Quotation Reminders in Taskip
sidebar:
  order: 4
---
**Taskip allows you to automate follow-up email reminders for quotations that have not yet been accepted. You can configure reminders to trigger before or after the quotation expiry date and personalize them using dynamic placeholders.**

### **Steps to Configure Quotation Reminders**

**1. Go to Settings\
Navigate to Settings from the sidebar.**

**2. Select Quotation Settings\
Choose Quotation Settings from the settings menu.**

**3. Open the Reminder Tab\
Click on the Reminder tab to begin setting up quotation follow-up emails.**

### **Configure a New Reminder**

**Send Reminder**

- **Choose whether to send the reminder Before Expiry Date or After Expiry Date.**
- **Define how many days before or after the expiry the reminder should be sent.**

**Reminder Email Subject**

- **Enter the email subject line.**
- **You can personalize it using variables such as `{{Contact_first_name}}` or `{{Quotation_subject}}`.**

**Reminder Message**

- **Customize the email body using the editor.**
- **Available placeholders include:**
  - **`{{Contact_first_name}}`**
  - **`{{Contact_last_name}}`**
  - **`{{Contact_email}}`**
  - **`{{Quotation_subject}}`**

**Toggle Reminder Status\
Enable or disable each reminder using the switch at the top-right of the reminder box.**

**Add Multiple Reminders\
Click Add Reminder to schedule additional reminders for the same quotation.**

**Save Changes\
Click Save Changes to activate your settings.**

### **Best Practices**

- **Use reminders to prompt clients before the quotation expires.**
- **Personalize content using contact names and quotation details.**
- **Use multiple reminders (before and after) to improve response rates.**

### **Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)**

### **Can I schedule multiple reminders per quotation?**

**Yes, you can add several reminders at different intervals.**

### **What dynamic fields can I use in quotation reminders?**

**You can use placeholders like `{{Contact_first_name}}`, `{{Quotation_subject}}`, and `{{Contact_email}}`.**

### **Do reminders stop once the quotation is accepted?**

**Yes. Once the quotation is accepted, reminders will no longer be sent.**

### **Can I temporarily turn off a reminder?**

**Yes. Use the toggle switch to disable any reminder without deleting it.**

### **Can reminders be deleted?**

**Yes. Use the trash icon to permanently remove any reminder.**
